<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy – Gamepad Tester" description="How Gamepad Tester handles controller input, analytics, advertising cookies and contact requests."><section class="article-hero"><div class="shell article-hero-inner"><span class="subpage-kicker">PRIVACY</span><h1>Input stays<br /><span>on your device.</span></h1><p class="lede">Controller, keyboard and mouse input is processed locally in your browser. No account is required. Last updated: November 7, 2026.</p></div></section><section class="subpage-content shell"><article class="info-card"><h2>Controller, keyboard and mouse input</h2><p>Gamepad buttons, axes, trigger values, key presses and pointer events are read by your browser to update the visible tester. These values are not uploaded to or stored on our servers, and they are cleared when you reload or close the page.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h2>Analytics</h2><p>We use Google Analytics to understand which tools are used and how pages perform. Google Analytics uses cookies and similar technologies to collect information such as pages viewed, approximate location, device and browser type, and referring pages. We do not send your test inputs to Google Analytics. You can learn how Google uses this data at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a> and opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h2>Advertising and cookies</h2><p>This site may show ads served by Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the internet.</p><p>You can opt out of personalised advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>. Where required by law, such as in the EEA and UK, we ask for your consent before personalised ads or non-essential cookies are used.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h2>Contact and changes</h2><p>If you email us, we use your address and message only to reply. We do not sell personal information. We may update this policy when the site changes; the date above shows the latest revision. Questions: <a href="mailto:nmlkareem161@gmail.com">nmlkareem161@gmail.com</a> or the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></article></section><RelatedTools hrefs={['/button-test/', '/stick-drift-test/', '/keyboard-test/', '/mouse-button-test/']} /></BaseLayout>
